'''The Secret of Psalm 46''' is a talk by Brian Moriarty. The talk is included in full as one of the playable videos in [[The Witness]]. Superficially, it is about video game eater eggs, encoding and finding secret messages in works of art, and puzzle hunts. But I interpret it more as a meditation on questions like: What drives people to do things (especially difficult things)? How does curiosity work? How does awe/mysterious strong driving force to make or do something work?

Tips:

* listen to this in a dark room, lying down, on headphones.

[[Jonathan Blow]] also reads part of this talk in one of his own talks https://youtu.be/AxFzf6yIfcc?t=2644

